# ── Portfolio chatbot (api/chat.ts) ────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env" for local testing, or set these in Vercel:
#   Vercel dashboard → your project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# WITHOUT a key, the chatbot still works — it falls back to smart
# pre-written answers. Add a key to turn on real AI (ChatGPT / OpenAI).

# Your OpenAI API key. Get one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-key-here

# Optional: which OpenAI model answers. Defaults to fast + cheap gpt-4o-mini.
# Use gpt-4o for higher-quality (pricier) answers.
# CHAT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
